  expeditionTitle: Quiet Shoal / Survey beacon
  introduction: Three shelters survived the storm. Read their survey marks and restore
    the island signal.
  surveyObjective: 'Survey each shelter: stand on its amber mark. Any order.'
  repairObjective: Rebuild the six cyan platform cells near spawn using RMB placement.
    Mine misplaced tiles with LMB.
  returnObjective: Jump onto the repaired platform. Stand beside the beacon and press
    F to send the signal.
  completeObjective: Signal restored. The island remains yours to explore and build.
    F6 starts a fresh survey; construction stays.
  initialMessage: Survey visits are session-only. F5/F9/F8 save and load tiles only.
  interruptedMessage: 'Signal interrupted: repair the platform and activate the beacon
    again.'
  missingSurveyMessage: Survey all shelter marks first.
  missingRepairMessage: The platform is incomplete. Fill every cyan cell with a solid
    tile.
  alreadyActiveMessage: Signal already active. Keep exploring or press F6 to replay.
  returnMessage: Stand on the repaired platform beside the beacon, then press F.
  successMessage: Signal sent. Survey complete; sandbox controls remain available.
  restartMessage: New survey started. Existing construction and tile saves are kept.
